  "48 hours normally. With overtime, total weekly work must not exceed 60 hours in any week and must average no more than 56 hours/week in a year. Road transport overtime cap: 150 hours/year.": "通常为48小时。含加班在内，任何一周的每周总工时不得超过60小时，且年均每周不得超过56小时。道路运输加班上限：每年150小时。",
