  "48 hours/week average maximum unless valid opt-out/exception applies": "除非适用有效的豁免/例外，每周平均最长48小时",
  "48 hours; 36 hours/week during Ramadan.": "48小时；斋月期间每周36小时。",
  "5-day and 6-day systems are both recognized. Standard contractual working time is 40 hours/week, but extra work/overtime rules differ by 5-day vs 6-day schedule.": "5天制和6天制均被认可。合同标准工时为每周40小时，但额外工作/加班规则因5天制和6天制不同而有所差异。",
  "5-day or 6-day schedules are possible within the 45-hour ordinary weekly cap.": "在每周45小时普通工时上限内，可采用5天制或6天制排班。",
  "5-day week with two days off or 6-day week with one day off. Daily work should generally not exceed 8 hours except cases allowed by the Labour Code or other laws.": "5天工作制享有两天休息，或6天工作制享有一天休息。除劳动法典或其他法律允许的情形外，每日工作时间一般不得超过8小时。",
  "5-day, 5.5-day or 6-day patterns may exist. Ordinary daily divisor rules recognize 5-day, 5.5-day and 6-day working weeks for monthly-paid overtime calculation.": "可能存在5天制、5.5天制或6天制模式。普通日均除数规则在月薪员工加班计算中认可5天制、5.5天制和6天制工作周。",
  "50% overtime bonus, or agreed time off in lieu. Time off in lieu accrues 1.5 hours per 1 overtime hour.": "加班奖金为50%，或按协议安排补休。补休按每1小时加班积累1.5小时计算。",
  "52 hours/week for general employees; 60 hours/week for night workers.": "一般员工每周52小时；夜班工人每周60小时。",
